  "solution": {
    "text": "On addition of conc. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math>. The equilibrium between two coloured Co (II) species can be described by equation<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mtext>Co</mtext><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mtext>aq</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mtext>Cl</mtext><mtext>aq</mtext><mo>-</mo></msubsup></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8652;</mo></mtd><mtd><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mtext>CoCl</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mtext>aq</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext><mfenced><mi>&#8467;</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced><mtext>Pink</mtext></mfenced></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mfenced><mtext>Blue</mtext></mfenced></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><br /><br />The equilibrium is disturbed by changing the conc. of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> ions by addition of conc. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math>&nbsp;in forward direction.<br />&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />&nbsp;"
